  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the coordination and capacity of Ministry of Livestock, Forestry and Range and other Somali institutions to control trade limiting livestock diseases</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of FAO in this project is to provide immediate technical assistance to the Federal Ministry of Livestock Forestry and Range to enhance livestock exports for the benefit of male headed and female dependent households along the livestock value chain</narrative>
